# Consistent retry metrics and a concise branded README
Workstream-ID: lea-38
GitHub-Issue: https://github.com/Zanark/LinkedIn-EasyApply-Automaton/issues/38
Publication: PUBLIC_SAFE_PROJECTION
Source-record: Reviewed bounded retry presentation and README curation request
Status: DONE
Milestone: Preserve truthful retry counters and simplify the project front page
Dependencies: lea-20, lea-34, lea-35

## Purpose
Keep the action tile and five numeric cards consistent across live Reapply and
browser-free retry previews. Distinguish saved failed/aborted history from
current application, hiring-message and invitation outcomes. Use the supplied
robot banner with transparent feathered edges on a shorter README, linked to
detailed existing guides.

## Tasks
- [x] Trace retry eligibility, live application/outreach counters and missing preview cards.
- [x] Preserve predecessor tracking and create a fictional isolated source candidate.
- [x] Add strict, private-data-free preview counts without changing live outcomes.
- [x] Keep list-only state confined to Reapply and retain the five-card arrangement.
- [x] Add the selected feathered README banner and relocate detail to linked guides.
- [x] Qualify CLI transport, actual child updates, empty/error states and both themes.
- [x] Refresh affected fictional media and deliver the qualified source locally.
- [x] Reconcile the scoped issue, Project item and persistent backlink.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Live retry retains Scanned, Applied, Skipped, Failed and HR sent.
- [x] Preview shows targets, last-failed/aborted jobs, prior attempts and repeated jobs.
- [x] Preview opens no browser, starts no automation run and implies no sends.
- [x] Unknown values remain unavailable until a complete valid snapshot arrives.
- [x] The action tile stays beside the responsive cards with its existing size/artwork.
- [x] README shows the selected banner, useful visuals and concise linked navigation.
- [x] Existing live, draft, dry-run, unconfirmed and invitation semantics remain distinct.
- [x] One scoped issue-backed Project item/backlink and all 37 predecessors are preserved.
- [x] Private inputs, unrelated work, independent apps and published v0.2.4 remain unchanged.

## Completion evidence
The hidden list-only state previously hid the cards and could leak into other
actions. Restrict it to Reapply. Keep the existing action tile and live cards;
use Targets, Failed, Aborted, Attempts and Repeated for the explicit historical
preview. All five counts derive from the same retrieved batch. A complete
successful empty result shows zeroes; missing or failed results stay unavailable.
The preview creates no automation run and never invokes the browser or outreach.

Add a strict, complete version-three snapshot alongside unchanged live-counter
and activity contracts. Invalid records retain the last valid values. Ordinary
CLI output and live application, draft, dry-run, unconfirmed, outreach and
invitation outcomes retain their existing meaning. Live retry can still send
configured approved hiring messages and report outreach failures separately.

All 183 focused protocol, CLI, process and GUI cases pass. Coverage includes an
actual fictional CLI child, empty/error cases, no automation-record writes,
hidden-checkbox scope and both themes at compact, standard and expanded sizes.
Focused Black/Ruff pass on nine changed Python files; mypy passes 75 source
files. Direct native presentation inspection confirms the retained 112x108 tile,
full labels, five cards and wrapping footer. These are fictional technical and
presentation checks, not live LinkedIn qualification or human acceptance.

Use the final supplied banner with transparent feathered edges, preserving its
central artwork. README is 80 lines with 343 rendered words including the
collapsed glossary. Link setup/reference detail and keep all 36 icons available.
Refresh the affected fictional walkthrough frame; retain unchanged stills and
original SVG bytes. Direct local Markdown/browser review covers desktop
light/dark and mobile light, expanded glossary, loaded images and no horizontal
page overflow. This is not a published-page observation.

Deliver exactly 21 qualified source/test/guide/media files locally and verify
their exact candidate bytes and original-source import identities. Preserve
251 unrelated tracked file hashes/mtimes, HEAD, staging, selected private-file
metadata and independent dashboard process creation identities. A running
shared checkout is not an immutable build. Keep issue #38, its single existing
Project item and durable workstream/index backlinks; completion is scoped to
that mapping and preserves all 37 predecessor objects and mappings.

No live LinkedIn action, real applicant fixture, installed-app change,
independent-runtime control, commit, push or release is included. Published
v0.2.4 remains unchanged.

